{"articleNo":"129021","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=129021&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대구통학버스] 6월 월권 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.05.19","hit":"2970","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>2015학년도 1학기 <u>6월권 대구통학버스</u> 신청일정을 안내하오니 통학버스 월권 이용자께서는 반드시 기간 내 신청 및 납부하여 주시기 바랍니다. </strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>&nbsp;1. 신청기간 : 2015. 5.20.(수) ~ 5.27.(수)</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>&nbsp;2. 신청방법 : 원스톱서비스-학생지원-대구통학버스신청</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp; </p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>&nbsp;3. 발전후원금 납부기간 : 2015. 5.20.(수) ~ 5.27.(수)</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>&nbsp;4. 발전후원금 납부금액 </strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong> - 월권(6월) : 금96,000원</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>&nbsp;5. 납부방법 : 고지서를 출력하여&nbsp;농협은행, 대구은행&nbsp;개인별 </strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가상계좌번호 </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>중&nbsp;선택하여&nbsp;입금</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;<strong><font color=\"#0055ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">문의) 학생처 학생지원팀 054-478-7044</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
